    "title": "Sweat Wallet",
    "description": "The easiest way to walk into crypto. With no payment required, anyone can start minting SWEAT, a cryptocurrency, with their steps.\r\n\r\nIn the Sweat Wallet, stake your SWEAT in Grow Jars to earn a % return and rewards!\r\n\r\n*************************\r\n\r\nRewards\r\n\r\nStake SWEAT to earn rewards!\r\n\r\nRewards have different levels. The more you stake, the better rewards you can access.\r\n\r\nRewards include:\r\n\r\nCrypto prizes \r\nGift vouchers to bluechip brands \u2013 Amazon, Nike, Adidas\r\nEvent tickets \u2013 major sport events, concerts and more\r\nCommunity benefits\r\nStablecoins - coming soon\r\n\r\n*************************\r\n\r\nAdditional features:\r\n\r\nOne-click log in\r\nTransfer \u2013 send SWEAT to others\r\nBattle against friends using Sweat Hero",
